<view class="self-page">
  <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="self-state">正在加载练习记录…</view>
  <view wx:elif="{{failed}}" class="self-card self-state"><view>暂时无法查看练习记录</view><button class="self-retry" bindtap="onRetry">重新加载</button></view>
  <block wx:else>
    <view class="self-hero"><view class="self-badge">✓ 自主记录</view><view class="self-hero__title">练习已记录</view><view class="self-hero__date">{{recordedText}}</view></view>
    <view class="self-card"><view class="self-title">练习内容</view><view class="self-row"><text>练习</text><text>{{actionLabel}}</text></view><view class="self-row"><text>记录方式</text><text>自主记录</text></view><view class="self-row"><text>记录时间</text><text>{{recordedText}}</text></view></view>
    <view class="self-card"><view class="self-title">关于这条记录</view><view class="self-copy">这条练习由您自主记录，暂无视频和动作分析结果。</view></view>
    <view class="self-card self-next"><view class="self-title">想看看动作做得怎么样？</view><view class="self-copy">拍摄一小段完整动作，获取动作观察和建议。</view><button class="self-button" bindtap="onChooseAction">查看动作指导</button></view>
  </block>
</view>
